OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan moving back to
OL,4,AUK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are
OL,7,Fplanning to move back to the UK, the
OL,8,FBBC understands.
OL,10,FAs first reported by the Daily
OL,11,FTelegraph, external and the Sun,,
OL,12,Fexternal Prince Harry and Meghan intend
OL,13,Fto relocate from the US later this
OL,14,Fmonth to a private, non-royal residence
OL,15,Foutside of London.
OL,17,FThe couple's children, Prince Archie,
OL,18,Fseven, and Princess Lilibet, five, are
OL,19,Fenrolled to start at a British school
OL,20,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
