OL,3,ATrack defect found near derailment site
OL,4,A- report
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail and Greater Thameslink
OL,7,FRailway, whose Southern Rail train was
OL,8,Finvolved in the crash, said in a joint
OL,9,Fstatement they were "sorry this
OL,10,Fhappened on our railway".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
