OL,3,AIsrael opens up bids for
OL,4,Ahighly-sensitive West Bank settlement
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael has opened up tenders for the
OL,8,Fconstruction of some 1,200 settlement
OL,9,Fhomes in a strategically important part
OL,10,Fof the occupied West Bank, as the
OL,11,Fgovernment seeks to end any chance of a
OL,12,FPalestinian state.
OL,14,FPlans to build on the so-called E1 area
OL,15,F- east of Jerusalem - have long been
OL,16,Finternationally condemned.
OL,18,FThe development would in effect divide
OL,19,Fthe West Bank in two and isolate East
OL,20,FJerusalem.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
